                 containing a range of trace minerals/micronutrients;
      (ii) Boron – promotes germination;
                 Needed for cell wall and seed formation;
                 Important in sugar translocation and carbohydrate metabolism;
                 Ways to correct deficiency: add boron in an acidic form (boric acid or Solubor)/add a fertilizers
                 containing a range of trace minerals/micronutrients;

